  "title": "MemoryProfileGetResponse",
  "description": "Success payload for memory.profile.get (§7.23). Errors use the shared ErrorEnvelope (§14.1) with details.retry_class (§14.2). Codes documented for memory.profile.get (§7.23): No profile-read-specific codes are documented beyond NOT_AUTHORIZED.. Dispatch-layer codes op_unsupported / capability_missing apply at the Connect boundary.",
